# CODEOWNERS — defines required reviewers for each path.
# GitHub uses this to automatically request reviews on PRs.
# Syntax: <pattern> <@owner or @org/team>
#
# More specific patterns override less specific ones (last match wins).
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# ── Default owners for all files ─────────────────────────────────────────────
